{"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StateManagement","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ThemingGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusSystem","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/AppearanceAndColors","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Preferences","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/CustomViews","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/KeyboardShortcuts","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PaletteReference","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ListAndTable","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/LayoutSystem"],"title":"Guides","generated":true,"anchor":"Guides"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PlatformImageLoader","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageLoader"],"title":"Loading","anchor":"Loading"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageDecodingLimits","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RGBAImage","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RGBA","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageLoadError"],"title":"Data and Limits","anchor":"Data-and-Limits"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/tuikit\/imagedecoding"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PlatformImageLoader","type":"reference"},{"text":" uses vendored, namespaced pure Swift format decoders and always returns non-premultiplied 8-bit RGBA pixels in an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RGBAImage","type":"reference"},{"text":". Animated images and formats other than PNG and JPEG are not supported. JPEG input is limited to 8-bit grayscale and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"three-component color images.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The format decoder is independent from file and URL lifecycle code. Decoding the same bytes with the same limits therefore produces the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"same pixels without accessing the network.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Loading-Data-or-Files","type":"heading","text":"Loading Data or Files","level":2},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let loader = PlatformImageLoader()","let fromData = try loader.loadImage(from: encodedData)","let fromFile = try loader.loadImage(from: \"\/absolute\/path\/image.png\")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Both entry points apply the same validation and return "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageLoadError","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" when the input cannot be read or decoded."}]},{"anchor":"Resource-Limits","type":"heading","text":"Resource Limits","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Configure "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageDecodingLimits","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" when creating the loader:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let limits = ImageDecodingLimits(","    maxInputBytes: 8 * 1_024 * 1_024,","    maxDimension: 4_096,","    maxPixelCount: 12_000_000,","    maxFrameCount: 1,","    maxDecodedBytes: 48 * 1_024 * 1_024,","    maxDecompressedBytes: 48 * 1_024 * 1_024",")","let loader = PlatformImageLoader(limits: limits)"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TUIkit inspects the image header and validates encoded bytes, dimensions, pixels, frames, decompressed source samples, and the final RGBA"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"allocation before invoking a format decoder. A per-call "},{"code":"maxPixelCount","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" can tighten the loader-wide pixel limit but cannot loosen it."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"PNG ancillary metadata is discarded because "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RGBAImage","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" has no metadata surface. This also prevents compressed text or color-profile"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"chunks from allocating outside the image decompression limit. PNG image-data chunks are fed to the decoder in bounded pieces, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"malformed trailing decompressed data is rejected."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"URL loading streams encoded bytes and cancels the transfer as soon as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxInputBytes"},{"text":" is exceeded. Cached images are revalidated against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the current loader’s dimensions, pixels, frame, and final allocation limits before they are returned.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"article","metadata":{"title":"Image Decoding","role":"collectionGroup","modules":[{"name":"TUIkit"}],"roleHeading":"API Collection"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Load static PNG and JPEG images safely on macOS and Linux."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageDecoding","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/FocusSystem":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Navigate between interactive elements using the keyboard."}],"url":"\/documentation\/tuikit\/focussystem","title":"Focus System","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusSystem","role":"article","type":"topic"},"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/ThemingGuide":{"title":"Theming Guide","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIki